{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/b/28bb7ed4abedaa3710c37ed3b77c975f5491a71c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.5 \\times 10^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/0/cd0de15abca60acc068550a2088a4e15e68b8f7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.8 \\times 10^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/a/b3a8bbf2631a9fd9afbf12bac618af4b5c453d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} 5.3 \\times 10^7 \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad 6.3 \\times 10^7 \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad 6.3 \\times 10^{12} \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad  5.3 \\times 10^1 \\quad \\text{(E) NOTA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"585\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiply:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/e/85e4b1497800b604c8a7304d0c2f9c7ffb42c948.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(3.5 \\cdot 10^3)(1.8 \\cdot 10^4) = (3.5 \\cdot 1.8)(10^3 \\cdot 10^4) = 6.3 \\cdot 10^7\\]\" width=\"412\" height=\"19\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a53d27d9b3277ee74927ed8daec2257efe927062.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_3\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 3\"> Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_5\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041659\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.0